      <floats-group id="article-820.s8">
        <fig id="article-820.image.f1" position="float" orientation="portrait">
          <caption>
            <p>Cerebrospinal Fluid Circulation. The illustration depicts&#x000a0;cerebrospinal fluid circulation through the subarachnoid space, arachnoid villi, and superior sagittal sinus. Key anatomical structures include the falx cerebri, meningeal and periosteal layers of the dura mater, and the arachnoid membrane. Contributed by B Parker</p>
          </caption>
          <graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="CSFCirculation" position="float" orientation="portrait"/>
        </fig>
