      <floats-group id="article-820.s9">
        <fig id="article-820.image.f2" position="float" orientation="portrait">
          <caption>
            <p>Cerebrospinal Fluid Distribution.&#x000a0;The illustration shows cerebrospinal fluid in relation to the cerebral cortex, brainstem, and spinal cord. Illustration&#x000a0;by K Humphreys</p>
          </caption>
